---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About ScholarAB | Free Alberta Scholarship Directory"
  description="ScholarAB is a free scholarship directory built by Ilia Ivanov, a Medicine Hat high school student. No ads, no login, no data sold."
  ogTitle="About ScholarAB | Free Alberta Scholarship Directory"
  ogDescription="ScholarAB is a free scholarship directory built by Ilia Ivanov, a Medicine Hat high school student. No ads, no login, no data sold."
  ogUrl="https://www.scholarab.ca/about"
  currentPath="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">

    <h1 class="text-primary font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-6" style="font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,48px);">
      Built by a student,<br><span class="text-brand">for students.</span>
    </h1>

    <p style="font-size:clamp(13px,1.4vw,15px);color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:-0.005em;margin-bottom:24px;">There was a problem. Now it's fixed.</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 mb-10">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-tertiary);padding-left:10px;border-left:3px solid var(--brand-border);margin-bottom:10px;">The problem</h2>
        <p style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,16px);line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:-0.005em;">
          Scholarship information in Alberta was scattered across dozens of websites and school bulletin
          boards. There was no single place to find what was open, what was closing, or what you actually
          qualified for.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-tertiary);padding-left:10px;border-left:3px solid var(--brand-border);margin-bottom:10px;">The fix</h2>
        <p style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,16px);line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-secondary);letter-spacing:-0.005em;">
          ScholarAB is a free scholarship directory for Alberta high school students. Every listing is
          verified by hand. Deadlines are tracked. Nothing is scraped or auto-generated.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Principles glass card -->
    <div class="card p-6 mb-6">
      <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-tertiary);margin-bottom:16px;">How this works</p>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-subtle);font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;">🚫</span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mb-0.5">No ads, no sponsored listings.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-secondary">Nothing is paid placement. Listings are ranked by deadline, not by who paid.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-subtle);font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;">🔒</span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mb-0.5">No data collected.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-secondary">No name, email, or location. Bookmarks are stored locally on your device and never leave it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-3 items-start">
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-subtle);font-size:16px;flex-shrink:0;">👤</span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary mb-0.5">No account required.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-secondary">Everything is public and works on any device, instantly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Open source -->
    <div class="mb-8">
      <p style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:16px;">Open source under AGPL-3.0</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/scholarab/scholarab"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors text-secondary hover:text-primary"
          style="padding:12px 20px;font-size:16px;background:var(--bg-subtle);border:0.5px solid var(--border-card);"
        >
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          View on GitHub
        </a>
        <!--email_off--><a
          href="mailto:contact.scholarab@gmail.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors text-secondary hover:text-primary"
          style="padding:12px 20px;font-size:16px;background:var(--bg-subtle);border:0.5px solid var(--border-card);"
        >
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          contact.scholarab@gmail.com
        </a><!--/email_off-->
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Creator credit -->
    <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--text-secondary);">
      Created by <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/iliaivanov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity font-medium">Ilia Ivanov</a>, a <a href="https://mhhs.mhpsd.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">Medicine Hat High School</a> student.
    </p>

  </div>
</Layout>
